  "description": {
    "text": "The Pokémon Card Display Set Gift Box (宝可梦卡牌展示套礼盒) came out on 1 March 2024 with Nine Colours Gathering. Each box held one random special-art holo card, one of eight made in equal numbers, with a silicone display case themed to match it, a card sleeve, a clear card film and a random 25-card Nine Colours Gathering pack.\n\nIts eight cards each show a Pokémon with a trainer: Flapple, Flareon, Vaporeon, Frosmoth, Jolteon, Dusknoir, Eevee and Oranguru.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Dragon Pokémon return in Nine Colours Gathering, with the Dragon Resurgence and display set gift boxes (9 February 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15945.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSGC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 008",
    "sources": [
      {
